 &nbsp; 
 
 ⚙️ Amazon is shutting down its Mechanical Turk program, through which humans performed simple digital tasks, often for pennies per job. ( CNBC )

 👕 Abercrombie &amp; Fitch shares skyrocketed after the retailer beat revenue expectations and upped its forecast, with its namesake brand surging. ( Bloomberg )

 😈 Boston Scientific is grappling with a cyberattack that has disrupted its global operations, sending its stock down. ( CBS News )

 
 
